1
00:00:00,007 --> 00:00:03,343
You highlighted everything. So why
does so little stick?

2
00:00:04,209 --> 00:00:07,040
Meet Lumen. Turn your own
notes into recall.

3
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:09,257
Bring in your own lecture notes,

4
00:00:09,257 --> 00:00:11,424
handouts, or photos. They stay private,

5
00:00:11,424 --> 00:00:12,507
on your device.

6
00:00:12,557 --> 00:00:16,133
Everything you need to study lives
in one calm library.

7
00:00:16,784 --> 00:00:18,690
Read with a pen, a highlighter,

8
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:20,912
and sticky notes, right on the page.

9
00:00:21,008 --> 00:00:24,137
Then close the page, and
explain it from memory.

10
00:00:24,137 --> 00:00:26,222
That is where real learning happens.

11
00:00:26,272 --> 00:00:30,040
Quiz yourself on any page, and get a
summary of what matters.

12
00:00:30,489 --> 00:00:34,109
A five step learning loop.
Six study methods.

13
00:00:34,109 --> 00:00:35,467
Zero automatic uploads.

14
00:00:35,517 --> 00:00:37,423
Recall cards ask before they tell,

15
00:00:37,423 --> 00:00:40,917
and the schedule adapts to how
well you knew each one.

16
00:00:40,994 --> 00:00:43,172
Every highlight and note is gathered,

17
00:00:43,172 --> 00:00:45,350
searchable, and linked to its page.

18
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:49,384
Proven study methods, explained simply,
so you know why they work.

19
00:00:49,616 --> 00:00:51,477
And when it is time to focus,

20
00:00:51,477 --> 00:00:53,072
Lumen keeps you in the zone.

21
00:00:53,831 --> 00:00:57,040
One menu holds every tool. Copy a region,

22
00:00:57,040 --> 00:01:01,052
magnify, define a word, then
present or export your work.

23
00:01:01,102 --> 00:01:04,566
Drag stickers onto the page, and
look up any word,

24
00:01:04,566 --> 00:01:06,992
with help in many languages,
including Arabic.

25
00:01:07,042 --> 00:01:10,213
A magnifier follows your pointer.
Mark what matters,

26
00:01:10,213 --> 00:01:13,385
and every highlight is saved
beside its page.

27
00:01:13,435 --> 00:01:15,540
The study studio brings it back.

28
00:01:15,540 --> 00:01:18,346
Recall cards, quick quizzes
and a practice lab,

29
00:01:18,346 --> 00:01:20,451
all linked to your own sources.

30
00:01:20,501 --> 00:01:23,241
And make it comfortable.
Daylight or evening,

31
00:01:23,241 --> 00:01:26,372
warm paper, your text size,
and gentle motion.

32
00:01:26,422 --> 00:01:27,333
Open Lumen free, and make your next
revision session count.

